&nbsp;
</blockquote></div>
Where has this been stated? If a link can be provided that the source will not be recalculated, then why hasn&#39;t it been done so already? If there is no such link, then why I you saying it like it&#39;s a fact?

[/quote]

To be fair, nothing says it does either. There is no other precedent to cite in favor or against. Thats why its being debated in the first place.
